  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Effective September 22, 2026.</p>

  <p>
    This Policy explains what personal data my apps process, why, with whom it is shared and how you can exercise your
    rights. It is based on Brazil's General Data Protection Law (Law No. 13,709/2018, “LGPD”) and applies to every app
    listed in section 2. This English text is a translation; if there is any conflict, the
    <a href="/privacy/" hreflang="pt-BR">Portuguese version</a> prevails.
  </p>

